iki/Gondians\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gondians\">Gondian</a> Gnomes. His plan to blow up the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Factory</a> is horrendous to contemplate; there must be a way to avoid causing so many deaths.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715171259\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1587/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18246/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5010/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 881454/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.567      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   35.567      1 -total\n 47.18%   16.781      7 Template:Icon_text\n 37.26%   13.252     15 Template:Trim\n 20.74%    7.377      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.58%    6.253      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.66%    5.215      1 Template:Ifexist\n 13.94%    4.959      2 Template:CharLink\n 12.58%    4.475      7 Template:Ifempty\n 12.26%    4.359      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12843-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715171259 and revision id 328446. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}